WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.570
OPENING

00:56.420 --> 00:58.350
The change in Sana...

00:59.420 --> 01:02.520
No doubt about it. There's something here.

01:02.520 --> 01:04.650
What are you doing?

01:06.930 --> 01:09.530
Nothing. Just relaxing.

01:09.530 --> 01:11.730
How is Sana doing?

01:12.930 --> 01:15.730
She regained consciousness a little while ago.

01:16.970 --> 01:19.440
She's been calling for you.

01:19.440 --> 01:22.900
I see. Well, then...

01:23.510 --> 01:25.380
What happened?

01:27.480 --> 01:31.480
The fatigue from everything that's happened
must have finally gotten to her.

01:37.860 --> 01:51.230
Sora ni toketa hane o matoi tobitate tsubasa de

01:37.860 --> 01:44.470
Cloaked in feathers melted into the sky

01:44.470 --> 01:51.240
Take flight on wings

02:05.580 --> 02:08.750
Morokute nigai kajitsu no you ni

02:05.590 --> 02:08.760
Like fragile but bitter fruit

02:08.750 --> 02:11.960
Hito no kokoro o miryou suru no

02:08.760 --> 02:11.970
It fascinates people's hearts

02:11.960 --> 02:15.060
Togi sumasareta shiroi yubi de

02:11.970 --> 02:13.470
The shadow that manipulates

02:13.470 --> 02:15.070
With sharpened fingers gleaming white

02:15.060 --> 02:18.230
Ayatsuru kage wa chi no kaori

02:15.070 --> 02:18.240
Smells of blood

02:18.230 --> 02:31.230
Shizumi aseta kodou o yobi samasu shi no sasayaki

02:18.240 --> 02:24.680
The whisper of Death

02:24.680 --> 02:31.240
That awakens fading heartbeats

02:32.210 --> 02:38.580
Sora ni toketa hane o matoi

02:32.220 --> 02:38.590
Cloaked in feathers melted into the sky

02:38.580 --> 02:44.820
Tobitatsu no wa gin no tsubasa

02:38.590 --> 02:44.830
Silver wings take flight

02:44.820 --> 02:51.300
Fukai kaze ni tsume o tatete

02:44.830 --> 02:51.300
Become the power that tears at deep winds

02:51.300 --> 03:01.030
Kirisaku chikara to nare

02:51.300 --> 03:01.040
With poised claws

03:02.020 --> 03:05.210
Brought to you by
BiG-GuY Fansubbing

03:05.810 --> 03:09.830
Episode 6
Rampage

03:18.790 --> 03:20.020
Who's there?

03:27.870 --> 03:28.840
Ando!

03:32.310 --> 03:33.540
You bastard!

03:35.580 --> 03:37.710
Where the hell are they?

03:37.710 --> 03:38.880
Who are you talkin' about?!

03:38.880 --> 03:40.350
Don't play dumb with me!

03:40.350 --> 03:43.940
A young girl and two guys.
They're taking refuge here, aren't they?!

03:44.590 --> 03:46.690
You Logos dog!

03:46.690 --> 03:49.920
Kill me if you want to!
I'd rather die than tell you!

04:03.070 --> 04:04.110
Did he fess up?

04:04.110 --> 04:08.800
Yeah, but I wish I could've had
a little more fun with him.

04:11.650 --> 04:14.520
Venus is in Chikura's home.

04:14.520 --> 04:18.390
All right. Commence mission, Code 2A2.

04:18.390 --> 04:20.550
Capturing the target is our main priority.

04:21.520 --> 04:22.850
Sana.

04:30.130 --> 04:32.120
Are you okay, Sana?

04:32.630 --> 04:35.600
I'm okay. I'm fine now.

04:38.670 --> 04:40.740
Your fever's gone too.

04:40.740 --> 04:42.240
What a relief.

04:42.240 --> 04:44.230
Thank you, Jin.

04:44.480 --> 04:46.170
"Thank you, Jin."

04:47.120 --> 04:51.920
For cryin' out loud, Jin's the only name
you ever call, Princess.

04:53.720 --> 04:55.550
Wh-What's going on?!

04:56.360 --> 04:57.960
We have a problem, Master!

04:57.960 --> 05:01.560
A powerful jamming signal
is covering the entire village.

05:01.560 --> 05:02.360
What?

05:02.960 --> 05:04.370
Take a look at this.

05:04.370 --> 05:07.330
The radar and communication
with the outside have been cut off.

05:07.940 --> 05:10.230
Where's the source of the jamming?

05:11.270 --> 05:12.810
Right here.

05:12.810 --> 05:15.810
Point C1. Near the entrance to the valley.

05:15.810 --> 05:19.450
Use Morse Code to tell everyone to assume
Level 1 combat positions.

05:19.450 --> 05:21.320
We'll go scout out just how strong our enemy is!

05:21.320 --> 05:22.480
Yes, sir!

05:22.820 --> 05:25.220
If anything happens, please take care of Sana.

06:18.810 --> 06:20.300
So you're over there now.

06:44.630 --> 06:46.400
G-Gladiators!

07:03.420 --> 07:04.580
Master!

07:05.290 --> 07:06.910
Gladiators!

07:07.460 --> 07:09.120
Are they Phantom?

07:12.790 --> 07:15.400
Kaneda! The Tengu lwa!

07:15.400 --> 07:17.170
Shoot the base of Tengu lwa!

07:17.170 --> 07:18.070
What?

07:18.070 --> 07:19.900
Oh, I get it.

07:19.900 --> 07:21.330
Let's go, Kaneda!

07:29.640 --> 07:31.130
Take this!

07:48.200 --> 07:50.870
All right! We did it, Master!

07:50.870 --> 07:52.770
Don't let your guard down yet!

07:52.770 --> 07:56.040
We're up against Phantom.
One cannot be too careful.

07:56.040 --> 07:57.100
Yes, sir!

08:41.520 --> 08:42.810
They're going out the back!

09:00.230 --> 09:03.400
Things don't always work out
according to the textbook.

09:07.240 --> 09:09.580
H-Hey, you planning on leaving Joe behind?

09:09.580 --> 09:12.640
You'd better stop your blabbing
or you'll bite your tongue!

09:28.000 --> 09:28.960
It's time.

09:30.870 --> 09:32.420
Roger.

09:33.800 --> 09:34.800
Connect that to this!

09:34.800 --> 09:36.240
This one too!

09:37.570 --> 09:39.160
All done over here!

09:44.880 --> 09:48.050
Master, the dynamite has all been set.

09:48.050 --> 09:51.350
Good. Have everyone standby at a safe location.

09:53.020 --> 09:54.790
What? What is it?!

09:54.790 --> 09:57.660
No! Everyone, run!

10:10.270 --> 10:12.510
You monster!

10:12.510 --> 10:13.560
Wait!

10:14.580 --> 10:15.800
DIE!

10:22.020 --> 10:23.210
Kaneda!

10:38.530 --> 10:40.430
Damn you...

10:42.600 --> 10:44.110
Don't do it, Kengo!

10:44.110 --> 10:46.600
Our own hands... With our own hands...

10:48.810 --> 10:50.740
Get back here, Kengo!

10:59.890 --> 11:01.980
Landing area sighted ahead.

11:14.200 --> 11:16.540
Task Control to all mobile units.

11:16.540 --> 11:20.630
Target is moving along the south slope
in the direction of three o'clock.

11:21.410 --> 11:23.210
Capture them immediately.

11:23.780 --> 11:26.470
Roger. Let's come around them, Riki.

11:28.250 --> 11:30.840
What's wrong? Come in, Riki!

11:38.390 --> 11:40.260
Target confirmed.

12:05.250 --> 12:06.510
Sana! Hang on!

12:13.760 --> 12:15.060
We're not gonna make it!

12:15.060 --> 12:17.100
Gora! Take care of Sana!

12:17.100 --> 12:17.800
Jin!

12:17.800 --> 12:20.790
Take care of her? No way!
I've got nothing to do with this!

12:20.940 --> 12:21.700
Take this.

12:21.700 --> 12:23.470
Huh?

12:23.470 --> 12:26.410
Is that a Central Logos Platinum Card?

12:26.410 --> 12:28.310
There are no withdrawal limits.

12:28.310 --> 12:31.880
I'll do it! I'll do it! I humbly accept!

12:31.880 --> 12:33.450
Jin...

12:33.450 --> 12:35.640
It'll be okay.

12:38.490 --> 12:40.580
Come on, hurry up!

12:42.620 --> 12:43.890
Jin...

12:53.730 --> 12:54.830
No way in hell are you gettin' away!

13:06.650 --> 13:07.740
This way!

13:15.520 --> 13:16.990
Dead end.

13:17.460 --> 13:18.950
Gora...

13:20.290 --> 13:22.420
You're shaking, kid...

13:37.210 --> 13:39.770
So you're still alive? Joe!

13:48.960 --> 13:51.520
Riki, what's going on? Help us!

13:52.960 --> 13:54.430
What's wrong, Riki?

13:57.770 --> 13:58.770
Riki!

13:58.770 --> 13:59.560
What happened?

14:03.840 --> 14:04.860
Riki!

14:05.710 --> 14:06.600
Jin!

14:07.010 --> 14:08.110
You okay?

14:08.110 --> 14:10.370
Dammit, Jin! You trying to kill us or what?!

14:11.510 --> 14:12.850
Stop, Riki!

14:12.850 --> 14:14.840
What? What's going on?

14:15.550 --> 14:18.220
Riki's nervous system is showing abnormalities.

14:18.220 --> 14:20.820
Irregular noises in his thought patterns
are at a maximum!

14:20.820 --> 14:23.720
Riki, come in! Riki!

14:23.720 --> 14:25.490
His level of consciousness is declining.

14:25.490 --> 14:27.520
He'll soon fall into a state where
he will no longer be capable of fighting.

14:29.260 --> 14:32.160
Gunship sighted, approaching from two o'clock.

14:33.000 --> 14:34.900
It appears to be a ship-based
aircraft from the Ishin!

14:42.480 --> 14:45.610
Task Control to all units.

14:45.610 --> 14:46.980
Abort mission.

14:46.980 --> 14:49.180
Take Riki and withdraw immediately.

14:49.850 --> 14:52.390
Rendezvous point will be D201.

14:52.390 --> 14:53.120
Over and out.

14:53.120 --> 14:54.180
Roger.

14:58.130 --> 14:59.750
Jin!

15:02.900 --> 15:06.590
I protected Sana, just like you told me.

15:07.200 --> 15:08.430
Here.

15:11.240 --> 15:15.640
Yay! Wow... what should I buy? Meat buns,
doughnuts and ramen noodles!

15:21.020 --> 15:24.380
If we had just gotten a hold of their plans earlier...

15:51.780 --> 15:54.870
Old man! Hang in there, Old man!

15:55.150 --> 15:57.420
Toraji...

15:57.420 --> 15:59.390
So you came...

15:59.390 --> 16:00.790
Yeah.

16:01.660 --> 16:03.560
Sorry I didn't get here earlier.

16:03.560 --> 16:06.320
Sana...

16:13.830 --> 16:16.740
My granddaughter...

16:16.740 --> 16:18.710
Take care of her...

16:24.680 --> 16:27.610
I will. I promise.

16:30.420 --> 16:31.880
Old man!

16:33.550 --> 16:38.420
Carry out... your mission!

16:38.730 --> 16:41.430
Don't run away.

16:41.430 --> 16:45.690
You must do what you were meant to do.

16:46.400 --> 16:50.840
I'm counting on you... Toraji.

16:53.540 --> 16:57.240
Old man! Hang in there, old man!

17:11.060 --> 17:15.800
This device accelerates the
synchronization of neurotransmitters.

17:15.800 --> 17:21.540
Before this mission, I ordered the engineers
to install them in all of your Gladiators.

17:21.540 --> 17:23.170
In all of them?

17:23.170 --> 17:26.140
Then why did only Riki's Gladiator...

17:26.140 --> 17:30.380
During the mission, there must have been
some kind of trouble.

17:30.380 --> 17:33.910
In other words, you were
cracking the whip on us...

17:33.910 --> 17:36.350
And an extremely vicious whip at that!

17:36.350 --> 17:40.520
Why? Why didn't you tell us about
something that important?

17:40.520 --> 17:43.180
Do I need to clear it with you?

17:44.530 --> 17:48.790
Don't get cocky. There are tons of guys
who can replace you!

17:50.260 --> 17:51.490
Die!

17:58.010 --> 17:59.800
I'll have the devices removed.

18:00.010 --> 18:01.880
That is all I have to say.

18:01.880 --> 18:03.510
Take him away!

18:03.510 --> 18:04.210
Yes, sir.

18:04.210 --> 18:05.470
Yes, sir.
Yes, sir.

18:08.020 --> 18:10.680
Sure enough, he showed up, didn't he?

18:10.680 --> 18:11.990
I'm talking about Shiba.

18:11.990 --> 18:15.110
I'm sure he'll be harboring Venus
at a safer location next time.

18:17.420 --> 18:19.230
To Satsuma?

18:19.230 --> 18:21.800
You mean we're leaving this place?

18:21.800 --> 18:26.820
Yeah. You never know when
Phantom will attack again.

18:27.500 --> 18:30.000
Satsuma is my hometown.

18:30.000 --> 18:33.470
I have lots of old friends and people
I grew up with there.

18:33.470 --> 18:36.670
I'm sure they'll be able to harbor you.

18:37.910 --> 18:40.970
What's wrong? You don't wanna go?

18:41.520 --> 18:43.280
You kidding me?

18:43.280 --> 18:46.340
How much longer do you wanna stay
in a dangerous place like this?

18:47.250 --> 18:49.650
Do you want to stay here?

18:51.130 --> 18:53.460
Is it because if you leave,
you won't be able to take revenge?

18:54.030 --> 18:55.460
Revenge?

18:55.460 --> 18:56.860
If that's the case, then I'll stay here too.

18:57.430 --> 18:59.160
Sana...

19:05.540 --> 19:09.100
I understand, Sana. I'll go with you too.

19:09.540 --> 19:11.070
Really?

19:11.680 --> 19:14.580
Yeah, I'll protect you.

19:14.580 --> 19:16.550
I'll always stay by your side.

19:16.550 --> 19:18.290
Thank you, Jin!

19:18.290 --> 19:20.390
Hey, Jin.

19:20.390 --> 19:23.360
I can use this in Satsuma too, right?

19:23.620 --> 19:24.930
What an idiot!

19:24.930 --> 19:28.260
Do you really think you can use
the card of a fugitive?

19:28.260 --> 19:29.500
Huh?

19:29.500 --> 19:34.930
Huh? What?!

19:38.610 --> 19:39.970
Boss!

19:40.610 --> 19:44.300
We've finished treating the survivors for now.

19:45.610 --> 19:48.450
Are we giving them a ride again?

19:48.450 --> 19:52.290
That's right. Just like last time.

19:52.290 --> 19:53.620
Aye-aye, sir.

19:56.090 --> 19:57.150
You say that the Ishin showed up?!

19:58.060 --> 19:59.530
Don't be ridiculous!

19:59.530 --> 20:03.120
Didn't the Ishin sink during its test run?

20:04.200 --> 20:05.690
Take a look at this.

20:08.670 --> 20:11.900
Shiba?! Is this really Shiba?

20:12.370 --> 20:17.910
Yes. The Ishin, which had supposedly sank,
was sighted at the location Phantom was headed to.

20:17.910 --> 20:20.380
Shiba now acts as the leader of pirates,

20:20.380 --> 20:23.870
bringing together pirates from all over
and organizing them.

20:24.280 --> 20:26.190
That bastard...

20:26.190 --> 20:31.490
So he staged an accident to steal the Ishin,
and was waiting for the opportunity to revolt?

20:31.960 --> 20:34.090
That bastard...

20:34.090 --> 20:36.890
Where's the Ishin right now?

20:45.340 --> 20:51.400
Based on our reports, the National Defense Force
currently has a net set up in this area.

20:51.710 --> 20:57.380
An entire fleet from the Maritime Force has been
deployed to 200 kilometers off Tosa.

20:57.380 --> 21:00.090
They're going after them with such a huge force?

21:00.090 --> 21:02.850
What are we gonna do if they send
Venus to the ocean's bottom?

21:03.290 --> 21:05.260
I doubt that will happen,

21:05.260 --> 21:08.160
considering Shiba and the Ishin's potential.

21:09.360 --> 21:11.490
Now, as far as your mission goes...

21:27.610 --> 21:30.620
Man, there's a swarm of them out there.

21:30.620 --> 21:33.490
Looks like the huge one in the middle
is an aircraft carrier.

21:33.490 --> 21:34.820
What do you want to do?

21:34.820 --> 21:39.290
We could, of course, sit on the bottom
and let them pass us by.

21:39.290 --> 21:43.560
Unfortunately, I'm not very good
at just sitting idle.

21:43.560 --> 21:47.730
That's true. You never were the patient type.

21:48.700 --> 21:52.340
What do you mean by that?
You prick me with your words.

21:52.340 --> 21:54.010
Okay, I've made up my mind!

21:54.010 --> 21:57.110
Stow away the buoy antennas. Start the engine!

21:57.110 --> 21:58.810
C-Captain!

21:58.810 --> 22:00.380
What the heck are you up to?

22:00.380 --> 22:02.650
We're ramming right into them.

22:02.650 --> 22:05.590
Right into the middle of that fleet!

22:25.110 --> 22:29.620
Nagai kioku no hate ni

22:25.110 --> 22:29.580
If at the end of our long memory

22:29.580 --> 22:35.420
Time will tear us apart

22:29.620 --> 22:35.450
Toki ga bokura o wakatsu nara

22:37.460 --> 22:44.100
If at the end of my sweet memory with you

22:37.490 --> 22:44.130
Kimi to amai kioku no hate ni

22:44.100 --> 22:50.400
You and I become one again

22:44.130 --> 22:50.440
Mata bokura hitotsu nara

22:50.400 --> 22:57.580
From a quietly stretched arm's length away

22:50.440 --> 22:57.610
Sotto te nobashita kyori kara

22:57.580 --> 23:02.280
I will search for the meaning

22:57.610 --> 23:02.320
lmi o sagasu kara

23:02.280 --> 23:08.120
Can you hear it? The words dance in midair

23:02.320 --> 23:08.160
Kikoeru? Kotoba ga chuu ni mau

23:08.120 --> 23:13.930
We shall meet when our wish is granted

23:08.160 --> 23:13.960
Kanaeta toki ni deau

23:13.930 --> 23:17.600
Leaving only their reverse behind

23:13.960 --> 23:17.630
Reverse dake nokoshite

23:17.600 --> 23:21.000
The torn words

23:17.630 --> 23:21.030
Chigireta kotoba

23:21.000 --> 23:27.130
Blurred time and light

23:21.030 --> 23:27.170
Kasureta jikan to hikari

23:29.310 --> 23:33.640
I have found them now

23:29.340 --> 23:33.680
lma, mitsuketa kara

23:35.260 --> 23:47.440
<b><i>Next Episode</i></b>

23:45.090 --> 23:47.820
Next time on Innocent Venus:

23:48.490 --> 23:51.020
Episode 7
Scheme

23:48.520 --> 23:50.320
"Scheme"
